    <Text id="LOC_BETTER_MILITARY_ENGINEER_DESCRIPTION">
      <en_US>+1 charge and +1 movement for Military Engineer, ignore terrian movement penalty. Can build routes with resources instead of charge.</en_US>
      <zh_Hans_CN>军事工程师+1速度，+1使用次数，无视地形惩罚，使用资源而不是次数修建道路。</zh_Hans_CN>
    </Text>
  </LocalizedText>
